Project Z modified the vocabulary by filtering entries, decoding the space
marker, selecting a subset, and assigning new compression IDs. The upstream
model, weights and tokenizer runtime are not included.

Version 0.2 preset dictionaries
The static presets combine the above Gemma-derived vocabulary or its encoded
tokens with samples from the public-domain SQLite 3.45.3 source and docs.
Additional public calibration files supply entropy statistics. See
data/preset-v2.md, data/token-preset-v2.md and tools/vocab-sources.tsv.
